                    fix: keepalive needs systemd-logind on the system bus or a desktop session (GNOME, KDE, XFCE) on the session bus

Activity simulation
  ! uinput          no write access to /dev/uinput
                    fix: give your user access to /dev/uinput
  ! ydotool         ydotool is not installed
                    fix: install ydotool 1.x
  ! idle time       no idle source; activity is simulated on a fixed schedule
                    fix: install xprintidle for idle-aware simulation
  ! screen lock     cannot tell when the screen is locked
                    fix: activity keeps running while the screen is locked; on Linux this needs logind or a desktop screensaver (GNOME, KDE, MATE, Cinnamon, XFCE)
